      "filename": "Barack Obama meets Stephanie Tobe.jpg",
      "title": "File:Barack Obama meets Stephanie Tobe.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/Barack_Obama_meets_Stephanie_Tobe.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barack_Obama_meets_Stephanie_Tobe.jpg",
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 1000,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "Public domain",
      "artist": "Pete Souza",
      "description": "Oct. 11, 2015\n\n\"The President was playing golf at Torrey Pines Golf Course in San Diego, Calif. As he was finishing his round, he began to shake hands with guests waiting for a wedding ceremony about to begin. The bride and groom were waiting inside but when they looked out the window and saw the President, they decided to make their way outside. I made a grab shot as the bride, Stephanie Tobe, and her soon-to-be husband, Brian Tobe, came running to greet the President. I made sure to send a copy to the happy couple and both wrote back to me that they were extremely grateful to have the President 'crash' their wedding.\" (Official White House Photo by Pete Souza)",
      "dateCreated": "Taken on 11 October 2015, 19:59",
